\begin{theorem}[Untimed residue, derived; Lean
\code{sigUnforgeableRecent\_of\_timed}]\label{thm:timed-uniq}
In any timed execution satisfying the EUF-CMA bridge and no back-dating,
the untimed residue \code{SigUnforgeableRecent} holds for the projected log
--- at every recency window, the bar being a parameter the proof never uses.
\end{theorem}

